<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>

	<!-- Settings -->
	<!-- EN: Prevent animals from eating random stuff -->
  <ALConfigCuriosityEatingLabel>防止動物亂吃東西</ALConfigCuriosityEatingLabel>
	<!-- EN: It mostly prevents your animals from eating drugs without a nutrition and stuff outside their allowed zones. They would still eat your food if it is in their allowed zone. -->
  <ALConfigCuriosityEatingTooltip>這選項主要是防止你的動物吃沒有營養的成癮品和在它們的允許活動範圍以外的東西。如果食物在它們的允許活動範圍內，動物仍然會吃。</ALConfigCuriosityEatingTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Predators hunting your pawns are considered hostile by your entire faction -->
  <ALConfigHostilePredatorsLabel>捕獵殖民地動物和殖民者的野生掠食者將被成為敵對目標</ALConfigHostilePredatorsLabel>
	<!-- EN: This does not change threat response of your pawns, it only makes them able to recognize a threat. -->
  <ALConfigHostilePredatorsTooltip>這個選項不會改變殖民者對威脅的反應，這只會讓他們能夠識別一個威脅。</ALConfigHostilePredatorsTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Convert eggs ruined by temperature into unfertilized chicken eggs -->
  <ALConfigEggConversionLabel>把因極端溫度損壞的各種蛋變成未受精的雞蛋</ALConfigEggConversionLabel>
	<!-- EN: This does not affect already ruined eggs. -->
  <ALConfigEggConversionTooltip>這個選項並不會影響使用此選項之前的就已受損的蛋。</ALConfigEggConversionTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Convert any generic animal meat into chicken meat upon butchering -->
  <ALConfigMeatConversionLabel>屠宰時將任何動物的肉轉換成雞肉。</ALConfigMeatConversionLabel>
	<!-- EN: This does not affect already butchered meat. -->
  <ALConfigMeatConversionTooltip>這個選項並不影響使用此選項之前就已屠宰產生的肉類。</ALConfigMeatConversionTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Harvest wool when butchering -->
  <ALConfigShearCorpsesLabel>屠宰時收穫毛料</ALConfigShearCorpsesLabel>
	<!-- EN: Only works with vanilla "shearable", not exotic resource used by some mods. -->
  <ALConfigShearCorpsesTooltip>僅適用於原版遊戲中的“可剪毛”動物，不適用於某些模組添加的稀有產物。</ALConfigShearCorpsesTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Medical alerts for animals -->
  <ALConfigMedicalAlertsLabel>動物急救警報</ALConfigMedicalAlertsLabel>
	<!-- EN: Shows right-hand alerts for when colony animals are injured, need rescuing or in critical medical condition. -->
  <ALConfigMedicalAlertsTooltip>當殖民地動物受傷、需要救援或需要急救時，會在屏幕右側顯示警報。</ALConfigMedicalAlertsTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Wildness threshold for tameness decay {0}%. Vanilla: 10.1%. -->
  <ALConfigTamenessDecayThresholdLabel>開啟訓練度衰減機制的野性閾值{0}%。（野性高於此閾值的動物才會產生訓練度衰減。原版：10.1%。）</ALConfigTamenessDecayThresholdLabel>
	<!-- EN: Set to 100% to prevent losing tameness for all animals. -->
  <ALConfigTamenessDecayThresholdTooltip>當設置為100%時，所有動物的訓練度都不會衰減。</ALConfigTamenessDecayThresholdTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Training decay speed {0}. Vanilla: 100%. -->
  <ALConfigTrainingDecaySpeedFactorLabel>訓練度衰減速度{0}。原版：100%。</ALConfigTrainingDecaySpeedFactorLabel><!-- No % after wildcard is intentional. -->
	<!-- EN: Set to 1% to make it as slow as possible. -->
  <ALConfigTrainingDecaySpeedFactorTooltip>當設置為1%時，訓練衰減速度將極為緩慢。</ALConfigTrainingDecaySpeedFactorTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Tags for animals in trade and caravan interfaces -->
  <ALConfigTradeHintsLabel>動物在貿易和商隊界面的標籤</ALConfigTradeHintsLabel>
	<!-- EN: Shows animal's sex, training and wool growth. -->
  <ALConfigTradeHintsTooltip>顯示動物性別，訓練度和毛髮生長情況。</ALConfigTradeHintsTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Allow animals to use nutrient paste dispenser -->
  <ALConfigAnimalsCanUseFoodDispenserLabel>允許動物使用營養膏合成機</ALConfigAnimalsCanUseFoodDispenserLabel>
	<!-- EN: Animals would be capable of pressing that button. Warining: contains a minor detour (extremely unlikely chance to have a conflict). If animals still don't use the dispenser, check if the building iself is in the allowed area. -->
  <ALConfigAnimalsCanUseFoodDispenserTooltip>動物也將會使用合成機按鈕。注意：此處有極低概率會造成衝突。如果選擇後動物仍然不會使用合成機，請檢查建築是否在允許活動區域內。</ALConfigAnimalsCanUseFoodDispenserTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Hauling MTB {0}h. Vanilla: 1.5h. -->
  <ALConfigHaulingMTBLabel>搬運MTB{0}h.原版:1.5h.</ALConfigHaulingMTBLabel>
	<!-- EN: 'MTB' stands for 'Mean Time Between'. Setting to 0 drastically increases productiveness, but can affect performance with large amount of trained animals. -->
  <ALConfigHaulingMTBTooltip>“MTB”代表“隨機搬運間隔時間”。設置為0可以顯著提高搬運效率，但會影響動物邏輯。</ALConfigHaulingMTBTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Show extra stats for pawns -->
  <ALConfigShowExtraDisplayStatsLabel>顯示額外動物統計信息</ALConfigShowExtraDisplayStatsLabel>
	<!-- EN: Shows some stats that vanilla misses, like resource production. -->
  <ALConfigShowExtraDisplayStatsTooltip>顯示一些原版未顯示的信息，例如產出信息等。</ALConfigShowExtraDisplayStatsTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Always show animal relations -->
  <ALConfigAlwaysShowRelationsLabel>總是顯示動物親緣關係</ALConfigAlwaysShowRelationsLabel>
	<!-- EN: By default, only relations with named animals are displayed. This allows to see all of them. -->
  <ALConfigAlwaysShowRelationsTooltip>默認情況下，只有被命名的動物會顯示親緣關係。這個選項會顯示所有動物的親緣關係。</ALConfigAlwaysShowRelationsTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Toxic buildup rot chance multiplier: {0}% -->
  <ALConfigToxicBuildupRotLabel>中毒死亡腐爛概率修正</ALConfigToxicBuildupRotLabel>
	<!-- EN: By default, animals killed while having major toxic buildup have a chance to rot immediately. It is intended to make toxic fallout more difficult, but has a side effect of cobras being unable to eat their prey, so they tend to kill every small animal on map and die from starvation. Set to 0% to entirely remove rot chance, set to 100% for vanilla formula. -->
  <ALConfigToxicBuildupRotTooltip>默認情況下，當處於中毒狀態的動物死亡時有一定概率立即腐爛。此設定的目的是提高有毒塵埃事件難度，但有一個副作用，被眼鏡蛇捕獵的動物也有一個中毒狀態，同樣可能在死亡時觸發立即腐爛，這導致眼鏡蛇獲取食物困難，所以他們往往會殺死地圖上的每一個小動物，死於饑餓。設置為0可完全消除腐爛幾率。</ALConfigToxicBuildupRotTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Young animals are easier to handle -->
  <ALConfigTamingAgeFactorLabel>幼年動物更容易受訓</ALConfigTamingAgeFactorLabel>
	<!-- EN: Makes non-adult animals easier to tame and train, effectively reducing their wildness. Proportinal to their relative age - newborn are much easier, while almost adult are barely affected. -->
  <ALConfigTamingAgeFactorTooltip>使幼年動物更容易馴服和訓練，有效降低它們的野性，使其與年齡成正比，新生幼崽顯著降低，快成年的幾乎不受影響。</ALConfigTamingAgeFactorTooltip>

	<!-- Extra stats -->
	
	<!-- EN: Wool type -->
  <WoolType>產毛類型</WoolType>
	<!-- EN: The type of wool this creature will yield when sheared. -->
  <Stat_Race_WoolType_Desc>此動物產毛的類型。</Stat_Race_WoolType_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Wool amount -->
  <WoolAmount>毛產量</WoolAmount>
	<!-- EN: The amount of wool yielded when shearing this creature and time it takes to grow wool. -->
  <Stat_Race_WoolAmount_Desc>此動物單次產毛量及產毛週期。</Stat_Race_WoolAmount_Desc>
	
	<!-- EN: Milk type -->
  <MilkType>產奶類型</MilkType>
	<!-- EN: The type of milk this creature will yield when milked. -->
  <Stat_Race_MilkType_Desc>此動物產奶的類型。</Stat_Race_MilkType_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Milk amount -->
  <MilkAmount>奶產量</MilkAmount>
	<!-- EN: The amount of milk yielded when milking this creature and time it takes to produce milk. -->
  <Stat_Race_MilkAmount_Desc>此動物單次產奶量及產奶週期。</Stat_Race_MilkAmount_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Milk female only -->
  <MilkFemale>僅雌性產奶</MilkFemale>
	<!-- EN: Some species may produce milk regardless of sex, but for most only females can be milked. -->
  <MilkFemaleExplanation>有些動物可以不分性別產奶，但對大多數物種來說，只有雌性才可以產奶。</MilkFemaleExplanation>
	
	<!-- EN: Product type -->
  <AL_ResourceType>產出類型</AL_ResourceType>
	<!-- EN: This animal can produce some type of resource that is not considered milk or wool. Note, that this one can be less reliable since it is used for modded animals with some kind of custom production rules. -->
  <AL_ResourceType_Desc>此動物可以生產一些不被認為是奶或毛的資源。請注意，這些僅存於某些Mod中的動物。</AL_ResourceType_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Product amount -->
  <AL_ResourceAmount>產出量</AL_ResourceAmount>
	<!-- EN: The amount of resource harvested from this creature and time it takes to grow. -->
  <AL_ResourceAmount_Desc>此動物單次產出量及產出週期。</AL_ResourceAmount_Desc>
	
	<!-- EN: Eggs type -->
  <EggType>產蛋類型</EggType>
	<!-- EN: The type of eggs this creature will lay. -->
  <Stat_Race_EggType_Desc>此動物產蛋的類型。</Stat_Race_EggType_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Eggs amount -->
  <EggAmount>蛋產量</EggAmount>
	<!-- EN: The amount of eggs in a clutch and how long it takes to produce them. -->
  <Stat_Race_EggAmount_Desc>此動物單次產蛋量及產蛋週期。</Stat_Race_EggAmount_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Eggs female only -->
  <EggFemale>僅雌性產蛋</EggFemale>
	<!-- EN: Some species may produce eggs regardless of sex, but for most only females can do that. -->
  <EggFemaleExplanation>有些動物可以不分性別產奶，但對大多數物種來說，只有雌性才可以產奶。</EggFemaleExplanation>
	<!-- EN: Eggs must be fertilized -->
  <EggNeedFertilization>僅產受精蛋</EggNeedFertilization>
	<!-- EN: Some species may produce unfertilized eggs, but many others would not. -->
  <EggNeedFertilizationExplanation>有些物種可以產出未受精的蛋，但是大多動物不會這樣。</EggNeedFertilizationExplanation>
	<!-- EN: Eggs incubation -->
  <EggIncubation>孵化時間</EggIncubation>
	<!-- EN: How much times it takes for an egg to hatch. -->
  <EggIncubationExplanation>蛋孵化需要的時間。</EggIncubationExplanation>
	
	<!-- EN: Mature age -->
  <TimeToMature>成熟年齡</TimeToMature>
	<!-- EN: How much time it takes to reach reproductive age, age when it can produce milk/wool, or last defined life stage for species that can't reproduce. They are the same age for most species. -->
  <TimeToMatureExplanation>達到能夠繁殖的年齡，或能產奶/產毛的年齡，或此物種最後一個生命階段所需的時間。對於大多數物種來說，這些生命階段都是同一個。</TimeToMatureExplanation>
	
	<!-- EN: Gestation period -->
  <GestationPeriod>妊娠期</GestationPeriod>
	<!-- EN: How much times it takes to produce a new offspring. -->
  <GestationPeriodExplanation>需要多少時間才能生產一個新的後代。</GestationPeriodExplanation>	
	<!-- EN: Litter size -->
  <LitterSize>同胎生仔數</LitterSize>
	<!-- EN: How many offsprings can be produced at once. -->
  <LitterSizeExplanation>一次能產生多少個後代。</LitterSizeExplanation>

    <!-- Medical Alerts for Animals -->
    <!-- EN: Animal needs treatment -->
  <AnimalNeedsTreatment>動物需要治療</AnimalNeedsTreatment>
    <!-- EN: Animals need treatment -->
  <AnimalsNeedTreatment>動物需要治療</AnimalsNeedTreatment>
    <!-- EN: These animals need medical treatment. Without it, they may die of their wounds, or their wounds may become permanent.\n\n{0} -->
  <AnimalNeedsTreatmentDesc>以下動物需要治療。如果沒有及時治療，動物可能會死於傷口失血，或者會變成永久性傷疤。\n\n{0}</AnimalNeedsTreatmentDesc>

    <!-- EN: Animal needs rescue -->
  <AnimalNeedsRescue>動物需要救援</AnimalNeedsRescue>
    <!-- EN: Animals need rescue -->
  <AnimalsNeedRescue>動物需要救援</AnimalsNeedRescue>
    <!-- EN: These animals are incapacitated on the ground:\n\n{0}\nSend a colonist to rescue them and carry them back to bed.\n\n(To rescue, select a colonist, then right click on the victim and select Rescue.) -->
  <AnimalsNeedRescueDesc>以下動物倒地無法行動:\n\n{0}\n派遣一個殖民者去救援他們，並把動物帶回床上。\n\n（如果要救援動物，請選擇殖民者，然後右鍵單擊倒地動物並選擇救援。）</AnimalsNeedRescueDesc>

    <!-- EN: Medical emergency (animals) -->
  <AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDisease>急救（動物）</AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDisease>
    <!-- EN: Animals are at risk of death because of severe illness:\n\n{0}\nIf possible, consider amputating or replacing infected limbs in order to keep animals alive. -->
  <AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDiseaseAmputationDesc>以下動物有死亡危險：\n\n{0}\n如果可能的話，請考慮截肢或替換受感染的肢體，以此保證動物的存活。</AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDiseaseAmputationDesc>
    <!-- EN: Animals are at risk of death because of severe illness:\n\n{0}\nMake sure that they get the best medical care possible. -->
  <AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDiseaseDesc>以下動物有死亡危險：\n\n{0}\n確保動物得到最好的醫療護理。</AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDiseaseDesc>

</LanguageData>